    "1 (16 ounce) package frozen bite-size potato nuggets (such as Tater Tots®)",
    "1 pound ground beef",
    "1 (15.5 ounce) can sloppy joe sauce",
    "0.5 cup shredded Cheddar cheese, or as desired"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 425 degrees F (220 degrees C). Arrange potato nuggets in a single layer on a baking sheet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until light golden and crisp, 20 to 24 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat a large skillet over medium-high heat. Cook and stir beef in the hot skillet until browned and crumbly, 5 to 7 minutes; drain and discard grease. Add sloppy joe sauce and simmer until heated through, 5 to 10 minutes.",
